{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o113b","title":"武昌报礼宾殿甘露","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o113b-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"武昌报礼宾殿甘露","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o113b-q"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"year":236,"label":"嘉禾五年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y236","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o113","basis":"嘉禾五年"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o113b-q","wuzhu-q-o113","houfei-q-o025","houfei-q-b-64a27e8dc3dd5339d73a"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o113b-q","source_order":[47,564,"O113b"],"order":8326}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-q-b-64a27e8dc3dd5339d73a","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-64a27e8dc3dd5339d73a","layer":"modern","quote":"〖16〗四年：青龙四年（公元 236）。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":114,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-bd98b8bd7ce8c71de9ac","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-q-o025","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-0744a279ae4c62a54e64","layer":"original","quote":"青龙二年春，追谥后兄俨曰安城乡穆侯。夏，吴贼寇扬州，以像为伏波将军〖12〗，持节，监诸将东征〖13〗。还，复为射声校尉〖14〗。三年薨〖15〗，追赠卫将军，改封魏昌县，谥曰贞侯。子畅嗣。又封畅弟温、4 、艳，皆为列侯。四年〖16〗，改逸、俨本封，皆曰魏昌侯，谥因故〖17〗。封俨世妇刘为东乡君〖18〗，又追封逸世妇张为安喜君。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":97,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":163,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o113b-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-56f9d22ba18041334d05","layer":"original","quote":"〔三〕月，武昌言甘露降于礼宾殿。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":52,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":50,"end":66,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o113","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-56f9d22ba18041334d05","layer":"original","quote":"五年春〖15〗，铸大钱，一当五百。诏使吏民输铜〖16〗，计铜畀直〖17〗；设盗铸之科〖18〗。（二）〔三〕月，武昌言甘露降于礼宾殿。辅吴将军张昭卒〖19〗。中郎将吾粲获李桓〖20〗；将军唐咨〖21〗，获罗厉等。自十月不雨，至于夏。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":52,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":115,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
